## 4. STEP 1: INSTRUCTIONS (AGENT ROLE)

### Illustration Concept
- **Visual:** A person typing into a configuration interface
- **Elements:** 
  - Code editor or settings panel
  - Role definition text area
  - Tone selector (Professional/Friendly/Direct)
  - Behavior checkboxes

```tsx
<InstructionsIllustration t={t} />
```

