## 6. STEP 3: MCP TOOLS (CONNECT TO 100+ APPS)

### Illustration Concept
- **Visual:** Grid of app icons connecting to central MCP hub
- **Elements:**
  - Central MCP hub (glowing circle)
  - 10-12 app icons in grid (CRM, Calendar, Payment, Email, etc.)
  - Connection lines showing data flow
  - "700+ apps" badge

```tsx
<MCPToolsIllustration t={t} />
```

### Content
| Field | Content |
|-------|---------|
| **Icon** | `<Wrench className="h-5 w-5" />` |
| **Title** | `t('howItWorks.step3.title')` |
| **Description** | `t('howItWorks.step3.desc')` |
| **Accent** | `text-amber-400` |

### App Examples to Show:
- Salesforce, HubSpot (CRM)
- Google Calendar, Outlook (Calendar)
- Stripe, PayPal (Payments)
- Gmail, Slack (Communication)
- Shopify, WooCommerce (E-commerce)
- Notion, Confluence (Knowledge)
- Salesforce Service Cloud, Zendesk (Support)

