## 7. STEP 4: WORKFLOW INTEGRATION (HIGHLIGHT)

### Illustration Concept
- **Visual:** Workflow builder interface with automation nodes
- **Elements:**
  - Workflow canvas with draggable nodes
  - "700+ Apps" badge prominently displayed
  - XCorp branding/logo
  - Active automation example (e.g., "Lead → CRM → Email → SMS")
  - Connection to Agent Help Desk

```tsx
<WorkflowIllustration t={t} />
```

### Content
| Field | Content |
|-------|---------|
| **Icon** | `<Settings className="h-5 w-5" />` |
| **Title** | `t('howItWorks.step4.title')` |
| **Description** | `t('howItWorks.step4.desc')` |
| **Accent** | `text-purple-400` |
| **Badge** | "700+ Apps" |
| **CTA** | `t('howItWorks.workflow.cta')` |

### Workflow Features to Highlight:
- **700+ app integrations** — biggest in the industry
- **Visual workflow builder** — drag-and-drop automation
- **Direct Agent connection** — zero-code integration
- **Complex business flows** — multi-step, conditional logic
- **ActivePieces-style** — industry-leading automation platform

